  "question": {
    "text": "<p>What is the correct oder of electron gain enthalpy of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cl</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Te</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Po</mi></math></p>",
